---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import ImageProcessor from "../components/React/ImageProcessor";
---

<BaseLayout>
  <section class="py-24">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">
      <!-- Header -->
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">
          AI 智能一键抠图
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-slate-600">
          只需几秒钟，自动识别主体并去除背景，让创意设计更轻松
        </p>
      </div>
      <ImageProcessor client:load />
       <!-- Supported Formats Card -->
      <div class="border border-indigo-100 rounded-3xl p-8 shadow-sm max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6 flex items-center gap-2">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="size-6 text-indigo-600" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 16v-4"/><path d="M12 8h.01"/></svg>
          支持的文件格式与要求
        </h3>
        
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-6">
          <div>
            <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-800 mb-2">图像格式</h4>
            <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">
              JPEG、JPG、PNG（不支持 8 位、16 位、64 位 PNG）、BMP、WEBP
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-800 mb-2">图像大小</h4>
            <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">
              不超过 3 MB
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="border-t border-indigo-200/50  pt-6 space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-700">
          <div class="flex items-start">
            <span class="mr-2 text-indigo-400">•</span>
            <span>图像分辨率：大于 32×32 像素，小于 2000×2000 像素，最长边小于等于 1999 像素</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start">
            <span class="mr-2 text-indigo-400">•</span>
            <span>URL 地址中不能包含中文字符</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- Features Grid -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 my-12 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <!-- Feature 1 -->
        <div class="bg-white border border-slate-100 rounded-2xl p-6 flex items-start space-x-4 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
          <div class="bg-indigo-50 rounded-lg p-3 text-indigo-600 shrink-0">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="size-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m12 3-1.912 5.813a2 2 0 0 1-1.275 1.275L3 12l5.813 1.912a2 2 0 0 1 1.275 1.275L12 21l1.912-5.813a2 2 0 0 1 1.275-1.275L21 12l-5.813-1.912a2 2 0 0 1-1.275-1.275L12 3Z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-1">发丝级分割</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">
              采用最先进的 AI 视觉模型，精准识别头发丝等复杂边缘，处理效果自然逼真。
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Feature 2 -->
        <div class="bg-white border border-slate-100 rounded-2xl p-6 flex items-start space-x-4 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
          <div class="bg-indigo-50 rounded-lg p-3 text-indigo-600 shrink-0">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="size-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"/><polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10"/><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="15" y2="3"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-1">透明背景下载</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">
              支持一键导出透明 PNG 格式，也可直接更换背景色，满足电商、证件照等多种需求。
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Feature 3 -->
        <div class="bg-white border border-slate-100 rounded-2xl p-6 flex items-start space-x-4 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
          <div class="bg-indigo-50 rounded-lg p-3 text-indigo-600 shrink-0">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="size-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-1">高精准确度</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">
              经过海量图库训练，无论是人物、商品还是动物，识别准确率高达 99% 以上。
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Feature 4 -->
        <div class="bg-white border border-slate-100 rounded-2xl p-6 flex items-start space-x-4 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
          <div class="bg-indigo-50 rounded-lg p-3 text-indigo-600 shrink-0">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="size-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2v20"/><path d="M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-1">完全免费</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">
              无需注册，无限制使用次数，快速处理，即用即走，为您节省宝贵时间。
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
